Package: family-connect
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: nettrash <nettrash@nettrash.me>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: gnome-keyring, xdg-desktop-portal-gnome
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://nettrash.me/linux/familyconnect/support.html
Description: family chat and calls on the family's own server
 Family Connect is a chat for one household, or several, on a server the
 family runs itself. The messages live in that server's database, and the
 apps for iPhone, iPad, Mac, Android, Windows, the web and Linux talk to it
 for every chat.
 .
 Every family has one chat for all its members, and any two members can talk
 one to one: messages, photos, videos, voice notes, files, locations and
 polls, one-to-one voice and video calls, a family board and birthdays.
